{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act21side_level_act21side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act21side",
  "stageId": "act21side_05",
  "title": "Old Rules",
  "storyCode": "IS-5",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "df20c6273148b571d7e3adf95a7bd214e546ca24bd1a5a8bc6cd60f557e98ee7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g7_reception"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Though I considered the possibility that Leontuzzo was trying to pull a fast one on me behind my back, my suspicions were confirmed the moment I saw you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're the real deal, a flesh-and-blood Texas."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Allow me to introduce myself. I am Wallach of Famiglia Rossati."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're Columbian?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course. Most associates of Famiglia Rossati are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, how did you enjoy prison life here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There was nothing special about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Strange. Logically, you never should've spent so long in jail in the first place. Just what was Bellone thinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is there something unusual about obeying the law?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The law? What do the courts here in Siracusa have to do with the so-called law?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look at it this way. In most Siracusan cities, standing trial and going to jail is a common coming-of-age ritual for a young mafioso."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After that, his famiglia associates go pick him up, like a warrior returning home triumphant."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everything on the surface here is meaningless to those who live by the underworld's ways."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's your point?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You grew up in Columbia. Do I need to spell it out for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'A complete joke.' There's no other way to say it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But that's why we were able to establish ourselves here so easily."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you enjoy talking politics?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You obviously don't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "To be honest with you, I'm not a fan either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll get to the point then. Why aren't you dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "None of your business."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fine. Let me ask you a different question then. Why did you come back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Didn't Leontuzzo tell you already? I owe the Bellones a favor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, let me get this straight. You knew the Bellones wanted to bring you back to deal with us Rossatis, but you still went along with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I didn't know that until I got here, but... you could say that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your bluntness makes me wonder if there's something wrong with me, last of the Texases."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you going to tell me you forgot the Texas name used to rule all of Columbia's famiglie, large and small?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That your grandfather, Salvadore, was the lodestar for every associate of every famiglia in Columbia?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What the Texases left behind... has nothing to do with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nothing to do with you?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wallach smashes his fist into the coffee table next to him, and fresh blood begins to seep from his fingers.\nHe does not seem to realize it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You are Cellinia Texas! The granddaughter of Salvadore!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As long as you live, those things have <i>everything</i> to do with you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The mere mention of your name at a Rossati table forces us to change the way we do things!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Texas was our pride!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you know how much effort Giovanna put in to reunite the remaining Columbian famiglie so that Salvadore's blood and sweat would not go to waste?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you have any idea what it was like to finally give in to Signora Sicilia, traveling thousands of miles to go from Columbia to Siracusa?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In order to survive, we even gave up the technology to build a nomadic city, basically letting Siracusa construct a new one for free—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That was all because of the fall of Texas. It left us no choice but to accept this reality."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And now you, the last Texas, deign to set foot here like you own the damned place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Claiming that you have nothing to do with all this, that you're just here to pay off a debt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You even go so far as to stand against us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You owe the Bellones?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That you're even alive means you owe a much bigger debt to the Columbian famiglie!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I might owe Giovanna an explanation, but I don't owe a thing to the Columbians."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After I settle my accounts with the Bellones, I'm leaving Siracusa."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You think we'll take your word for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your very existence shakes the foundations of Famiglia Rossati."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where's Giovanna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm asking, why are you here? Instead of Giovanna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I speak for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She wouldn't, for example, grovel at Signora Sicilia's feet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Same as she wouldn't send a representative to meet me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You think you know her so well?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Judging from your expression, looks like I'm right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah... Isn't that unlucky."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Turns out I'm the one who doesn't know enough about the legendary Texas."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I always thought I was a pretty good actor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're not bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, you speak eloquently and at great lengths about Siracusa, as if you've seen through the country for what it is. It feels... very familiar to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I wouldn't keep doing that, if I were you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Because it proves... you don't understand this place well enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, you are right about one thing. Now that I'm back, I should go have a chat with Giovanna."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You won't be seeing her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry about this, last of the Texases."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're too much like a Siracusan. No, you <i>are</i> a Siracusan, through and through."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So I cannot let you see the Donna."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You'll shake her. And you'll shake others too. You'll bring ruin to a great many things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, please turn back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go close the deal you have with the Bellones, and then crawl back wherever you came from."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're free to do what you want from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, I'll ask you to bear one thing in mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Famiglia Rossati does not welcome you."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Texas stands up and walks to the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Unconsciously, the would-be assassins part and make way for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She looks around, reading anger, bewilderment, disgust, confusion, and other emotions in the eyes of the Columbians.\nThat is what her surname brings to the table.\nTexas.\nShe lets out a sigh and exits the room."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g11_mansionhall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What an unexpected guest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I want to see Bernardo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've already warned you several times before not to call the Don by his first name, Signorina Lavinia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know where he is, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Give me one reason why I should tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If standing here listening to you mock me from your position as the big winner is enough to get you to tell me, I'll gladly play along."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The big winner, huh...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whatever."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not like you knowing will do any harm. The Don already left for the Saluzzo mansion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You won't be able to see him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you want to stir up trouble in his household, that's on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But if the Don has decided to open discussions with the Saluzzos, I suggest you don't stick your head where it doesn't belong."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't need to tell me twice."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "One more thing, Signorina Lavinia."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't care what you think about me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, I hope you do remember this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Leon is a made man in this famiglia, and he was the first to deviate from our path."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We are all one famiglia, and a famiglia ought to stick together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your path?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's a nice euphemism for craven ambition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Demetri",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g1_srcstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A droplet of rain strikes the ridge of her eye socket and rolls down like a teardrop.\nNever in her life has Lavinia experienced rain so frigid and biting in Siracusa.\nBut she promptly wipes away the streaks.\nIt's too soon for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "Who is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm looking for Penguin Logistics."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "That's me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you have time right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "I have a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What services does your business offer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "We deliver letters, messages, goods, and... people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "Rain or shine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lavinia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Perfect. I have a job for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g8_srcroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, Sora, you went to Caterina's place after all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There are tons of resources here, and Miss Caterina even left her notes in a lot of these scripts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's really passionate about her job, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stop sighin', won'tcha?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everybody knows yer actin' thingy ain't just another way of chasin' Texas. Leastwise, you don't want it to be."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right. But, finding her is still our top priority..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After all, Lappland is back in Siracusa, and she's been doing some pretty crazy stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you think about, it makes perfect sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It always feels like she's there, wherever Texas shows up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you think she's doing it to help Texas?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lookin' at the scoreboard, Texas sure as sunshine got her name cleared. But ain't that kinda strange, whichever way ya look at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes. I'm sure she has her own goals."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gaaah, I don't have what it takes to deal with that woman."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Anyways, she ain't no friend of Texas, don't take a genius to know that much. But her attitude ain't much like an enemy, neither."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "End of the day, I just can't figure out for the life of me what it is she wants outta Texas."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, the mille-feuille she gave me earlier was really good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't wanna hear nothin' outta that hungry mouth of yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's kind of like how I used to look at Mostima. I couldn't figure her out, but after I gradually stopped thinking about her, she actually started to make sense to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I feel like it's the same with Lappland."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For people like her, there's no point trying to guess at what they're thinking. It's better to just accept what they say at face value."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Only if every word they say is true can you start to figure if they're ultimately trying to weave truths into a lie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Time for me to get some chow. Exusiai, you watch over things, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You got it~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sora, are you practicing your lines again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, hi there, Miss Caterina."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're about to start our performance of Act II of 'La Morte di Texas,' so I have to step it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, I completely forgot. Time sure has a way of sneaking up on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Exusiai, would you like some pizza?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure would!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "By the way, Miss Caterina, since you're the playwright, you'll be coming to watch the show, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I actually wanted to tell you that I'm going away for a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For how long?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well... It shouldn't be too long, if everything goes as planned."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry, it's nothing major. Something happened back home, and as the eldest daughter, I have to go back and get everything under control."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Being a big sister is hard work, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Haha. It's not so bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Unfortunately, I'm still not sure what to do for the climax of Act III."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*sigh*... Maybe I can find some inspiration back home this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come on, don't look at me like that. We just won't be seeing each other for a bit. I should still be able to find the time to come watch Act II."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who knows, maybe I'll surprise you backstage and invite you out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Really?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After all, I rarely get to make new friends, and I wouldn't want to miss the performance of a script I wrote myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right. That settles it then. If you're coming by, you have to let me know!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Caterina",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm off then. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bye bye~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "See you later~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g6_newtown_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Donna, you didn't bring any luggage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "After we're done here, I have to head back to finish my script. What's there for me to bring?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How have the Saluzzos and Bellones been reacting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Saluzzos invited Leontuzzo to a banquet, and the old wolf Bernardo agreed to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That banquet may end up very interesting, and everyone has eyes on it now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Should we respond in any way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wallach, help me make some travel plans."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm going to go watch the opening performance of 'La Morte di Texas' Act II."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wallach",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is the script you wrote that important to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course. It is the product of my painstaking labor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Also, didn't you just ask how we were going to respond?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That is my response, seeing how Bernardo Bellone is about to step away from his own theater."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giovanna",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_687_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Naturally, I, Giovanna Rossati, ought to return."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "aliases": [
        "Sora"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
